  "readmeFile": "Package.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds ReferenceTool/IReferenceResolver/InMemoryReferenceResolver (Universal.Operative.Sdk.Tools): a generic tool that fetches whatever content a reference URI (default scheme \"ref\", e.g. ref://rfp) points to, via a host-supplied IReferenceResolver -- in-memory, disk, database, remote API, or composed from several. Deliberately unopinionated about what a reference is; discovery is left entirely to the host, typically a line in the system prompt (ReferenceTool.SystemPromptHint gives a ready one that stays in sync with the configured scheme/name). Resolves to IReadOnlyList<Block> rather than plain text, so a reference can include non-text content. Both the URI scheme and the tool's own name are configurable via the constructor or EngineBuilder.AddReferenceTool(resolver, scheme, name), to register more than one on the same engine or fit a host's own vocabulary.",
